// Common-emitter BJT amplifier with divider bias, coupling capacitors and emitter bypass.
source Vcc 12V
source Vin 1V
transistor Q1 2N3904
resistor R1 10k
resistor R2 2.2k
resistor Rc 1k
resistor Re 100
resistor Rload 10k
capacitor Cin 10uF
capacitor Cout 10uF
capacitor Ce 100uF

connect Vcc.plus, R1.p1 to Rc.p1
connect Vcc.minus, R2.p2, Re.p2, Ce.p2, Vin.minus to Rload.p2
connect R1.p2, R2.p1, Q1.b to Cin.p2
connect Vin.plus to Cin.p1
connect Rc.p2, Q1.c to Cout.p1
connect Cout.p2 to Rload.p1
connect Q1.e, Re.p1 to Ce.p1

simulate op
